# Single APK policy

At all times there is exactly one production APK:

`downloads/SOS-X.Y.Z.apk`

The public download URL is:

`https://sos010.com/downloads/SOS-X.Y.Z.apk`

Do not keep a second copy in GitHub Releases.

## When releasing a new APK

1. Build the new APK.
2. Verify versionName and versionCode.
3. Verify SHA256.
4. Delete the previous `downloads/SOS-old.apk`.
5. Copy the new APK to `downloads/SOS-new.apk`.
6. Update `downloads/.gitignore` so only the new filename is un-ignored.
7. Update `apk-version.json`.
8. Update the APK version and download pointer in `pwa-installer.js`.
9. Verify `https://sos010.com/downloads/SOS-new.apk` works and the SHA256 matches.
10. Verify exactly one tracked `*.apk` exists.
11. Commit the new APK and the matching metadata together.

Never accumulate historical APK files in the main source tree.
